  "prefLabel": "Bar 402.04 Procedure, Method, and Standards for Imposing Sanctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bar 402.04 Procedure, Method, and Standards for Imposing Sanctions. Other than immediate license suspension authorized by RSA 310:12, IV, the board shall impose disciplinary sanctions pursuant to Plc 311.09 through Plc 311.11.\n\nSource. #14537, eff 4-24-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/bar100-700.html"
